WEBVTT

00:00:01.735 --> 00:00:03.770
Let me see...

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:07.240
I need to buy that and that and that...

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:10.107
And then, let me see...

00:00:12.946 --> 00:00:15.949
What's with her?

00:00:15.949 --> 00:00:18.975
Beats me. Why don't you ask her yourself?

00:00:25.725 --> 00:00:27.527
Solty.

00:00:27.527 --> 00:00:29.929
Yes? What is it?

00:00:29.929 --> 00:00:33.199
Why are you so... well...

00:00:33.199 --> 00:00:34.968
Um...

00:00:34.968 --> 00:00:36.002
How do I put this?

00:00:36.002 --> 00:00:38.104
Why do you look so happy?

00:00:38.104 --> 00:00:40.940
Uh, right, right. That's it.

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:42.108
Why is it?

00:00:42.108 --> 00:00:44.144
That is because...

00:00:44.144 --> 00:00:45.406
Because?

00:00:47.213 --> 00:00:48.181
It is a secret.

00:00:48.181 --> 00:00:49.315
Oh.

00:00:49.315 --> 00:00:52.786
Oh, that's because it's almost...

00:00:52.786 --> 00:00:57.857
Oh! Oh! It is nothing!
It is nothing at all!

00:00:57.857 --> 00:01:00.087
Well, there you have it.

00:01:01.127 --> 00:01:04.197
Hey, Solty!

00:01:04.197 --> 00:01:06.833
What was that about?

00:01:06.833 --> 00:01:08.733
Oh, well...

00:01:10.503 --> 00:01:18.244
You know the continuation of
the fairy tale I've wanted to hear about?

00:01:18.244 --> 00:01:24.945
If it's eternal happiness,
I'll forge it with my own hand

00:01:26.419 --> 00:01:36.396
It's like we were both seeking a
coincidence that was off by a page

00:01:36.396 --> 00:01:38.565
And that's how fate brought us together

00:01:38.565 --> 00:01:46.739
More than those words
that you once kept to yourself

00:01:46.739 --> 00:01:55.648
It's the kindness that made you
keep them to yourself

00:01:55.648 --> 00:02:02.555
That I want to have faith in now

00:02:02.555 --> 00:02:10.296
You know, we'll be living
alongside uncertainty from now on

00:02:10.296 --> 00:02:16.703
We used to have nothing to lose,
but that's not us now

00:02:16.703 --> 00:02:24.410
You know the continuation of
the fairy tale I didn't know about before?

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:30.750
If it's eternal happiness,
I'll forge it with my own hand

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:34.709
It's something to build up bit by bit

00:02:46.099 --> 00:02:49.502
Honestly! Please do not
scare me like that, Miss Rose.

00:02:49.502 --> 00:02:49.769
All right, all right. Sorry about that.

00:02:49.769 --> 00:02:52.138
"Birthday Game"
All right, all right. Sorry about that.

00:02:52.138 --> 00:02:53.873
"Birthday Game"
My bad.

00:02:53.873 --> 00:02:54.507
"Birthday Game"
This is a secret, you know.

00:02:54.507 --> 00:02:56.140
This is a secret, you know.

00:02:56.140 --> 00:02:58.108
You cannot tell him, you know.

00:02:58.108 --> 00:03:00.144
We are going to surprise him, you know.

00:03:00.144 --> 00:03:01.812
I know that!

00:03:01.812 --> 00:03:06.283
It's your own fault for
acting all excited out there.

00:03:06.283 --> 00:03:10.754
And anyway, holding a birthday party
in this day and age is...

00:03:10.754 --> 00:03:14.658
Oh, do you think so?
We have them every year.

00:03:14.658 --> 00:03:16.026
Right, Kasha?

00:03:16.026 --> 00:03:17.027
Yeah.

00:03:17.027 --> 00:03:19.263
It's fine for Kasha.
Kasha's a different story.

00:03:19.263 --> 00:03:20.931
But we're talking about that old man here.

00:03:20.931 --> 00:03:24.101
A birthday party for a
grown middle-aged guy is just...

00:03:24.101 --> 00:03:25.836
What are you saying?!

00:03:25.836 --> 00:03:27.871
Age has nothing to do with it!

00:03:27.871 --> 00:03:30.274
It is the spirit of celebration
that is important!

00:03:30.274 --> 00:03:32.843
My, what a sound opinion coming from you.

00:03:32.843 --> 00:03:36.180
That is what Ms. Miranda said.

00:03:36.180 --> 00:03:37.548
So you're just parroting what you heard.

00:03:37.548 --> 00:03:40.284
The day after tomorrow
is Mr. Roy's birthday.

00:03:40.284 --> 00:03:42.086
We are going to make
preparations in secret

00:03:42.086 --> 00:03:44.655
and hold a magnificent party.

00:03:44.655 --> 00:03:47.324
Mr. Roy is certain to be surprised!

00:03:47.324 --> 00:03:49.226
I don't know about that...

00:03:49.226 --> 00:03:52.696
I can't wait to see
the look on Roy's face.

00:03:52.696 --> 00:03:53.764
Yes!

00:03:53.764 --> 00:03:55.566
Are you in on this, too?

00:03:55.566 --> 00:03:58.802
It's a child's duty to humor the adults.

00:03:58.802 --> 00:04:00.337
Whoa...

00:04:00.337 --> 00:04:04.241
So please help us out, Miss Rose.

00:04:04.241 --> 00:04:06.539
Well, I don't mind, but...

00:04:08.178 --> 00:04:11.115
So, Ms. Miranda, about the dishes...

00:04:11.115 --> 00:04:14.251
Oh, right. I'll write you
detailed notes on it later.

00:04:14.251 --> 00:04:15.652
Also, for the decorations...

00:04:15.652 --> 00:04:20.057
- Oh, Kasha and I will take care of that,
so don't worry about it.
- Things are so ho-hum.

00:04:20.057 --> 00:04:21.888
You, too...

00:04:29.333 --> 00:04:31.101
Whoa...

00:04:31.101 --> 00:04:33.170
This is horrible...

00:04:33.170 --> 00:04:35.339
Is this all blood?

00:04:35.339 --> 00:04:38.175
The victim's name is Erel Beane.

00:04:38.175 --> 00:04:41.211
He was an engineer at
the RUC Resemble Laboratory

00:04:41.211 --> 00:04:44.081
and he had been missing for a couple days.

00:04:44.081 --> 00:04:47.151
An RUC person, huh?

00:04:47.151 --> 00:04:48.418
I see.

00:04:48.418 --> 00:04:50.788
No wonder we were brought in.

00:04:50.788 --> 00:04:52.322
Exactly.

00:04:52.322 --> 00:04:55.926
Why is there so much blood
splattered everywhere?

00:04:55.926 --> 00:04:57.928
According to the crime scene investigator,

00:04:57.928 --> 00:05:02.232
it's because a bomb was set
and detonated within the body.

00:05:02.232 --> 00:05:05.269
That is, things have been cleaned up now,

00:05:05.269 --> 00:05:06.703
but the crime scene initially contained

00:05:06.703 --> 00:05:12.242
the victim's scalp, both arms,
and both his legs below the thighs.

00:05:12.242 --> 00:05:14.278
Ugh.

00:05:14.278 --> 00:05:16.146
What's the victim's time of death?

00:05:16.146 --> 00:05:18.549
Considering the rigor mortis
of what remains were left,

00:05:18.549 --> 00:05:21.985
he died approximately 28-36 hours ago.

00:05:23.487 --> 00:05:26.223
This is an old abandoned building.

00:05:26.223 --> 00:05:28.158
The perpetrator kidnaps
a resemble engineer

00:05:28.158 --> 00:05:30.594
and kills him in a location
with medical equipment.

00:05:30.594 --> 00:05:32.596
The perpetrator's objective
was most likely...

00:05:32.596 --> 00:05:34.331
A resemble operation.

00:05:34.331 --> 00:05:35.465
Yes.

00:05:35.465 --> 00:05:38.602
And using a bomb to kill
his victim is an unusual MO.

00:05:38.602 --> 00:05:40.370
If we follow that lead,

00:05:40.370 --> 00:05:43.207
we should have a list of
likely suspects right away.

00:05:43.207 --> 00:05:46.343
Hey, this is grossing me out.

00:05:46.343 --> 00:05:48.812
Let's go back already.
Let's get out of here!

00:05:48.812 --> 00:05:50.143
What's this?

00:05:52.549 --> 00:05:53.982
Everyone...

00:05:57.287 --> 00:05:59.278
R-Run!

00:06:09.166 --> 00:06:10.500
Here.

00:06:10.500 --> 00:06:12.169
It's what you asked for.

00:06:12.169 --> 00:06:13.937
It's a list of the people
living in the lowest level

00:06:13.937 --> 00:06:16.173
who fit the description.

00:06:16.173 --> 00:06:19.509
Well, it's only a fraction of them, though.

00:06:19.509 --> 00:06:22.312
Does it look like your
daughter's among them?

00:06:22.312 --> 00:06:23.547
Hard to say.

00:06:23.547 --> 00:06:25.015
You owe me big for this.

00:06:25.015 --> 00:06:28.576
I'm letting Rose stay at my place.
That's more than enough.

00:06:31.555 --> 00:06:35.659
? Happy birthday to you.?

00:06:35.659 --> 00:06:39.196
? Happy birthday to you.?

00:06:39.196 --> 00:06:43.333
? Happy birthday, dear Roy...?

00:06:43.333 --> 00:06:44.357
Crap!

00:06:53.076 --> 00:06:57.570
Good grief, we were only
borrowing the bar before it opened.

00:06:59.483 --> 00:07:01.314
What the hell was that?

00:07:07.291 --> 00:07:09.793
Yo, my friend.

00:07:09.793 --> 00:07:12.921
Did you like my present?

00:07:14.031 --> 00:07:16.833
Hou!

00:07:16.833 --> 00:07:19.961
I'm so happy you remember me, Roy.

00:07:21.805 --> 00:07:23.170
Coming!

00:07:24.741 --> 00:07:26.576
Please wait a moment.

00:07:26.576 --> 00:07:30.047
So, why are we making
the birthday cake here?

00:07:30.047 --> 00:07:33.383
Because, it'd be bad if Roy
catches on to what we're doing, right?

00:07:33.383 --> 00:07:35.118
Who might you be?

00:07:35.118 --> 00:07:38.555
I have a package for you.

00:07:38.555 --> 00:07:40.716
Please sign for it.

00:07:43.226 --> 00:07:45.395
This is revenge.

00:07:45.395 --> 00:07:48.966
I got a new arm to replace
the one you destroyed.

00:07:48.966 --> 00:07:50.934
The advancement of
technology is amazing.

00:07:50.934 --> 00:07:54.071
I've got renewed respect for it.

00:07:54.071 --> 00:07:57.908
Thanks to it, I can make
even more precise bombs than before.

00:07:57.908 --> 00:07:59.476
When did you get out?

00:07:59.476 --> 00:08:03.146
Just a month ago. On my own initiative.

00:08:03.146 --> 00:08:04.281
Where are you?

00:08:04.281 --> 00:08:06.977
Oh, I don't know. Where do you think?

00:08:08.085 --> 00:08:11.688
Don't get mad. You're the main dish.

00:08:11.688 --> 00:08:13.824
Before I enjoy the main dish,

00:08:13.824 --> 00:08:16.019
I have to start with the hors d'oeuvres.

00:08:17.427 --> 00:08:19.963
You don't mean?!

00:08:19.963 --> 00:08:22.032
Who was at the door just now?

00:08:22.032 --> 00:08:24.935
Oh, it was a package addressed to Mr. Roy.

00:08:24.935 --> 00:08:26.136
To Roy?

00:08:26.136 --> 00:08:27.471
Who is it from?

00:08:27.471 --> 00:08:28.939
Let me see...

00:08:28.939 --> 00:08:30.941
A Mr. Hou Chu?

00:08:30.941 --> 00:08:32.033
Hou?

00:08:33.176 --> 00:08:34.244
Hou...

00:08:34.244 --> 00:08:35.412
Throw it away!

00:08:35.412 --> 00:08:37.147
Hurry! Get that package outside!

00:08:37.147 --> 00:08:38.171
What?

00:08:46.456 --> 00:08:49.092
Music to my ears. Nothing could be better.

00:08:49.092 --> 00:08:52.329
The bombs I make are truly works of art.

00:08:52.329 --> 00:08:54.731
You bastard!

00:08:54.731 --> 00:08:59.069
It's too bad I can't
see your face right now.

00:08:59.069 --> 00:09:03.507
But well, it's not a bad thing
to save the enjoyment for later.

00:09:03.507 --> 00:09:04.708
Hou!

00:09:04.708 --> 00:09:09.008
So don't die until then.

00:09:12.916 --> 00:09:14.247
What?!

00:09:21.358 --> 00:09:22.620
What was that?

00:09:54.257 --> 00:09:57.360
That was quite an ordeal
you two went through.

00:09:57.360 --> 00:09:58.895
This is a get-well gift.

00:09:58.895 --> 00:10:00.363
Take your time recovering.

00:10:00.363 --> 00:10:02.766
Oh, th-thank you.

00:10:02.766 --> 00:10:05.602
Oh, don't push yourself.

00:10:05.602 --> 00:10:07.471
I'm glad to see you're looking well.

00:10:07.471 --> 00:10:10.340
I have a meeting, so I have
to go back right away.

00:10:10.340 --> 00:10:11.975
Excuse me.

00:10:11.975 --> 00:10:15.145
Th-Thank you so much.

00:10:15.145 --> 00:10:16.510
Take care.

00:10:18.014 --> 00:10:20.550
Are we disturbing you guys?

00:10:20.550 --> 00:10:22.285
Disturbing. Totally disturbing.

00:10:22.285 --> 00:10:25.522
Wha?! D-Don't be ridiculous!

00:10:25.522 --> 00:10:28.391
Hey, hey, what about your get-well gift?

00:10:28.391 --> 00:10:29.626
Ow...

00:10:29.626 --> 00:10:30.827
Owowowowowow...

00:10:30.827 --> 00:10:33.630
What's this? You two actually
look pretty healthy.

00:10:33.630 --> 00:10:35.999
That's not true.

00:10:35.999 --> 00:10:40.303
So, any cakes? Melons? Fruits baskets?

00:10:40.303 --> 00:10:43.340
Here. Work-related accident forms.

00:10:43.340 --> 00:10:45.399
- Boring.
- Boring.

00:10:46.676 --> 00:10:49.146
Are you two going to be
working this case alone?

00:10:49.146 --> 00:10:50.614
Of course.

00:10:50.614 --> 00:10:53.984
You two just think about
getting well as quickly as possible.

00:10:53.984 --> 00:10:56.052
Well, we'll come by again.

00:10:56.052 --> 00:10:59.112
Um, please get well soon.

00:11:00.857 --> 00:11:02.893
Melon...

00:11:02.893 --> 00:11:05.162
What about the situational analysis
concerning the case?

00:11:05.162 --> 00:11:06.263
It's done.

00:11:06.263 --> 00:11:07.764
Do we have some idea of
who the culprit is?

00:11:07.764 --> 00:11:11.334
Based on the MO and its brutal nature,
one person came up.

00:11:11.334 --> 00:11:13.069
His name is Hou Chu.

00:11:13.069 --> 00:11:15.639
He is the perpetrator of
the serial building bombings

00:11:15.639 --> 00:11:16.873
that occurred several years ago.

00:11:16.873 --> 00:11:20.076
He escaped from Selvice Prison
a month ago.

00:11:20.076 --> 00:11:22.045
Pick up on his trail right away.

00:11:22.045 --> 00:11:23.512
All right.

00:11:35.158 --> 00:11:36.993
Talk about getting
caught in the crossfire...

00:11:36.993 --> 00:11:38.828
You can complain to me about it later.

00:11:38.828 --> 00:11:40.463
Rose had better be all right.

00:11:40.463 --> 00:11:43.300
I'm going to check on that now.

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:45.869
You're in the way. Hurry up and move!

00:11:45.869 --> 00:11:47.837
I'm stuck.

00:11:56.313 --> 00:11:58.915
Damn it!

00:11:58.915 --> 00:12:00.317
No one's answering.

00:12:00.317 --> 00:12:02.018
If something's happened to Rose...

00:12:02.018 --> 00:12:03.280
Shut up!

00:12:05.055 --> 00:12:06.089
Damn it!

00:12:06.089 --> 00:12:08.258
No one's picking up
at the hunters office, either.

00:12:08.258 --> 00:12:09.793
I'm going to go find Rose.

00:12:09.793 --> 00:12:10.794
Do that.

00:12:10.794 --> 00:12:13.330
W-Wait.

00:12:13.330 --> 00:12:14.864
Don't go.

00:12:14.864 --> 00:12:18.668
Please, don't go.

00:12:18.668 --> 00:12:20.499
Who are you?

00:12:22.572 --> 00:12:24.274
Get it.

00:12:24.274 --> 00:12:26.543
Answer the phone.

00:12:26.543 --> 00:12:28.170
Hurry!

00:12:39.089 --> 00:12:41.491
H-Hurry...

00:12:41.491 --> 00:12:42.719
Help me.

00:12:45.095 --> 00:12:46.997
Yo, my friend.

00:12:46.997 --> 00:12:49.065
Congratulations on making it out alive.

00:12:49.065 --> 00:12:51.635
Hou, you bastard...

00:12:51.635 --> 00:12:53.637
This is a game.

00:12:53.637 --> 00:12:56.139
You've successfully cleared the first stage.

00:12:56.139 --> 00:12:58.441
Next up is the second stage.

00:12:58.441 --> 00:12:59.876
What?!

00:12:59.876 --> 00:13:03.437
Do you see the box
in the middle of the road?

00:13:04.614 --> 00:13:07.751
Right, the one the child is looking at.

00:13:07.751 --> 00:13:11.721
There is a bomb rigged inside.

00:13:11.721 --> 00:13:16.726
That bomb is synchronized with
the bomb on the man behind you guys.

00:13:16.726 --> 00:13:19.929
If you don't disarm both at the same time...

00:13:19.929 --> 00:13:21.665
Boom.

00:13:21.665 --> 00:13:22.766
You son of a...

00:13:22.766 --> 00:13:25.468
I told you. This is a game.

00:13:25.468 --> 00:13:30.240
Don't worry. I'll instruct you
on how to disarm them.

00:13:30.240 --> 00:13:32.275
What if I say I won't do it?

00:13:32.275 --> 00:13:35.779
I've got a remote detonation switch.

00:13:35.779 --> 00:13:38.281
You want to try me?

00:13:38.281 --> 00:13:40.884
I'm happy you understand
the situation, Roy.

00:13:40.884 --> 00:13:43.920
But it'll be impossible
for me to disarm both at once.

00:13:43.920 --> 00:13:47.324
You've got an assistant
with you, don't you?

00:13:47.324 --> 00:13:50.894
Have Larry Anderson help you.

00:13:50.894 --> 00:13:52.662
I refuse.

00:13:52.662 --> 00:13:53.730
Hey!

00:13:53.730 --> 00:13:55.493
This is not my problem.

00:14:02.739 --> 00:14:05.542
You can't walk away from this,
my dear Larry.

00:14:05.542 --> 00:14:10.878
If you do that again,
I'll detonate the bomb on the man there.

00:14:13.183 --> 00:14:16.453
Fine. I'll play your sick game.

00:14:16.453 --> 00:14:19.786
Okay. Then let's start the game.

00:14:22.692 --> 00:14:24.828
Roy, you go to the other side.

00:14:24.828 --> 00:14:28.286
The panel inside the box will
tell you how to disarm the bomb.

00:14:31.901 --> 00:14:33.493
Moron!

00:14:34.604 --> 00:14:39.371
Mister, you should obey
the traffic lights.

00:14:41.077 --> 00:14:44.714
That's mine. Could I have it back?

00:14:44.714 --> 00:14:46.316
Is it really?

00:14:46.316 --> 00:14:51.187
Okay. Now, first, pull the blue wire.

00:14:51.187 --> 00:14:53.212
All right, don't move.

00:15:02.432 --> 00:15:05.299
First, remove the top cover, huh?

00:15:07.103 --> 00:15:09.672
I told you not to move!

00:15:09.672 --> 00:15:12.334
Damn, what's next?!

00:15:16.413 --> 00:15:18.381
This is a stupid game.

00:15:18.381 --> 00:15:21.782
Damn, what's next?! Hurry up and tell me!

00:15:25.155 --> 00:15:27.290
Damn it...

00:15:27.290 --> 00:15:28.757
Is this the one?

00:15:36.866 --> 00:15:40.670
Larry, pull that one out carefully now.

00:15:40.670 --> 00:15:43.969
Carefully... Carefully...

00:15:47.710 --> 00:15:49.179
Ah-ah!

00:15:49.179 --> 00:15:50.346
Be careful.

00:15:50.346 --> 00:15:56.686
It'll explode the instant the
metal ball inside touches either end.

00:15:56.686 --> 00:15:57.854
What?!

00:15:57.854 --> 00:15:59.289
Don't move!

00:15:59.289 --> 00:16:01.024
Ooh, that was close.

00:16:01.024 --> 00:16:03.860
You don't want to end up like
your younger brother, do you?

00:16:03.860 --> 00:16:04.894
What?!

00:16:04.894 --> 00:16:07.630
What did you do to Andy?!

00:16:07.630 --> 00:16:10.467
I don't know. He might be dead.

00:16:10.467 --> 00:16:15.038
Never mind that. Shouldn't you think
more about your own situation right now?

00:16:15.038 --> 00:16:18.041
I'll kill you, I swear.

00:16:18.041 --> 00:16:19.702
If you can manage that...

00:16:21.644 --> 00:16:23.480
Damn it!

00:16:23.480 --> 00:16:25.038
I couldn't read that!

00:16:26.015 --> 00:16:27.539
Get back!

00:16:30.019 --> 00:16:32.121
Good work.

00:16:32.121 --> 00:16:34.190
Just one more step left.

00:16:34.190 --> 00:16:37.460
But that's about all I can tell you.

00:16:37.460 --> 00:16:38.528
What?

00:16:38.528 --> 00:16:41.865
I told you, didn't I? This is a game.

00:16:41.865 --> 00:16:43.466
Quit screwing with us!

00:16:43.466 --> 00:16:46.903
It's the players' hearts that
determine the outcome of a game.

00:16:46.903 --> 00:16:51.007
I'd love to see you guys
win this game with your hearts.

00:16:51.007 --> 00:16:53.510
This was your plan all along, wasn't it?!

00:16:53.510 --> 00:16:56.104
The hint is "bravery".

00:17:01.117 --> 00:17:04.018
Bravery? Bravery?!

00:17:05.922 --> 00:17:08.558
It's nothing personal.
There's no time left.

00:17:08.558 --> 00:17:10.727
Get into the manhole back there!

00:17:10.727 --> 00:17:13.029
We're going to minimize
the casualties as much as possible!

00:17:13.029 --> 00:17:14.797
Y-You can't...

00:17:14.797 --> 00:17:16.424
Hurry it up!

00:17:28.378 --> 00:17:30.079
Stop, Larry!

00:17:30.079 --> 00:17:31.376
Don't shoot him!

00:17:49.632 --> 00:17:53.036
He played us.

00:17:53.036 --> 00:17:56.130
There were never any bombs.

00:17:59.676 --> 00:18:04.943
Hou Chu. I know your name now.

00:18:09.419 --> 00:18:14.390
A birthday present, huh? What a pain!

00:18:14.390 --> 00:18:17.860
But well, I am staying
at his place for free...

00:18:17.860 --> 00:18:22.031
I suppose it wouldn't hurt to be good
to my landlord once in a while.

00:18:22.031 --> 00:18:23.266
Pardon.

00:18:23.266 --> 00:18:24.597
Yes?

00:18:27.870 --> 00:18:28.805
Hey.

00:18:28.805 --> 00:18:30.907
Roy.

00:18:30.907 --> 00:18:32.942
So you're both okay.

00:18:32.942 --> 00:18:34.911
Yes, somehow.

00:18:34.911 --> 00:18:36.546
What about Solty?

00:18:36.546 --> 00:18:37.843
Yes?

00:18:39.649 --> 00:18:40.950
What is it?

00:18:40.950 --> 00:18:43.486
So you're okay, too.

00:18:43.486 --> 00:18:47.457
It was thanks to Solty that
this was all the damage it did.

00:18:47.457 --> 00:18:49.225
She was awesome!

00:18:49.225 --> 00:18:52.595
Solty flung the bomb outside
with all her might!

00:18:52.595 --> 00:18:53.892
Throw it away!

00:18:59.469 --> 00:19:03.640
Her face got covered in soot
because of the explosion, though.

00:19:03.640 --> 00:19:04.807
I see.

00:19:04.807 --> 00:19:06.843
Roy, Hou Chu is...

00:19:06.843 --> 00:19:08.144
I know.

00:19:08.144 --> 00:19:11.981
You guys gather as many hunters as
you can and get them to protect you.

00:19:11.981 --> 00:19:15.018
Don't go back to your apartment.
Stay at a hotel.

00:19:15.018 --> 00:19:16.352
I'll...

00:19:16.352 --> 00:19:18.479
You're planning to go up against Hou?

00:19:22.158 --> 00:19:23.893
I'll help you, too.

00:19:23.893 --> 00:19:26.362
After all, he made a mess
of my precious office.

00:19:26.362 --> 00:19:28.531
I will help as well.

00:19:28.531 --> 00:19:32.160
I-I don't want to be left all by myself.

00:19:35.238 --> 00:19:36.939
All right.

00:19:36.939 --> 00:19:39.876
It'll be easier to protect everyone
if you're all in one place.

00:19:39.876 --> 00:19:42.512
Start by finding Rose.

00:19:42.512 --> 00:19:44.639
After that, information on Hou.

00:19:55.458 --> 00:19:58.161
Did you find out where Rose is?

00:19:58.161 --> 00:20:00.063
I'm looking right now.

00:20:00.063 --> 00:20:01.531
What about Hou's trail?

00:20:01.531 --> 00:20:03.833
I tracked his whereabouts
up to two days ago,

00:20:03.833 --> 00:20:05.501
but I have nothing on him since then.

00:20:05.501 --> 00:20:06.869
Keep trying.

00:20:06.869 --> 00:20:07.893
I will.

00:20:32.228 --> 00:20:33.422
Solty.

00:20:35.832 --> 00:20:38.701
Yes? What is it?

00:20:38.701 --> 00:20:39.869
That melody...

00:20:39.869 --> 00:20:42.839
Oh, I learned it from Miss Rose.

00:20:42.839 --> 00:20:49.912
She said humming it relaxes you,
so I thought it might work on you, too.

00:20:49.912 --> 00:20:51.447
Mr. Roy?

00:20:51.447 --> 00:20:53.881
Rose was humming it?

00:21:01.724 --> 00:21:02.825
What's that?

00:21:02.825 --> 00:21:05.595
It was in the mail addressed to Roy.

00:21:05.595 --> 00:21:08.664
It tested negative for explosives.

00:21:08.664 --> 00:21:09.999
It's a video disc.

00:21:09.999 --> 00:21:11.567
A video disc?

00:21:11.567 --> 00:21:12.534
Yes.

00:21:14.504 --> 00:21:16.606
Yo, my friend.

00:21:16.606 --> 00:21:19.675
That game earlier was
pretty fun, wasn't it?

00:21:19.675 --> 00:21:22.912
I've got Miss Rose.

00:21:22.912 --> 00:21:27.884
Don't worry. As you can see,
she's still alive.

00:21:27.884 --> 00:21:32.221
The Crown Center Building
on South 3rd Street.

00:21:32.221 --> 00:21:34.690
Come alone.

00:21:34.690 --> 00:21:37.386
This is the start of the third stage.

00:21:53.641 --> 00:21:58.413
On a clear day in the park

00:21:58.413 --> 00:22:01.349
Looking up at the sky

00:22:01.349 --> 00:22:12.627
There was a tiny little cloud
that almost vanished

00:22:12.627 --> 00:22:17.365
Letting the wind take us where it will

00:22:17.365 --> 00:22:20.334
We live freely

00:22:20.334 --> 00:22:28.376
We make our way,
walking a little at a time

00:22:28.376 --> 00:22:33.147
We're the same

00:22:33.147 --> 00:22:37.885
This precious time

00:22:37.885 --> 00:22:41.722
Each time we meet

00:22:41.722 --> 00:22:51.265
This feeling of not being alone
turns into kindness

00:22:51.265 --> 00:22:57.839
I can turn it into
the courage to believe in someone

00:22:57.839 --> 00:23:10.115
And surely, before I vanish
into the far reaches of that sky...

00:23:17.291 --> 00:23:18.459
Miss Rose...

00:23:18.459 --> 00:23:20.495
No matter what, I will...

00:23:20.495 --> 00:23:21.395
Next time, "Beyond the Conclusion - Tears".

00:23:21.395 --> 00:23:23.798
"Beyond the Conclusion -Tears-"
Next time, "Beyond the Conclusion - Tears".

00:23:23.798 --> 00:23:27.165
"Beyond the Conclusion -Tears-"
